This directory contains platform-specific variable settings for the
GNU makefile. They are used by CI.

Please copy one of these up to ../make.inc and possibly modify for
your needs.

Barnett 1/7/25

The site files (make.inc.FI, make.inc.CIMS, make.inc.nersc_perlmutter) come
from the legacy standalone cufinufft repo's sites/ directory, and cover both
the CPU and GPU ('make cufinufft') builds. Its make.inc.nersc_cori,
make.inc.nersc_cgpu and make.inc.olcf_summit were dropped: those machines have
been retired (Cori 2023, Summit 2024). See docs/install_gpu.rst for the
equivalent CMake presets.
